# An option the agent made to close the card (action=close) ends the wait without a message (the core's decision.close).
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
wait 1000
tap 发消息
type 部署吗 {T} card:要不要部署 {T}|现在部署 {T}*|不需要部署 {T}!
tap icon:arrow-up
gone 正在发送
timeout 120000
until =不需要部署 {T}
wait 1500
shot 1-card
tap =不需要部署 {T}
gone =不需要部署 {T}
shot 2-closed
